---
import { faqs, medicalSource, program } from '../content';
import Action from './Action.astro';
---
<section id="safety" class="safety section wrap"><div><h2>Important<br/><em>information.</em></h2><p class="safety-note">Your health comes first.</p></div><div class="safety-content"><p>This page provides general information and does not replace medical advice. A licensed provider must determine whether treatment is appropriate. A consultation or assessment does not guarantee a prescription. Individual results vary.</p><p>Before treatment, discuss your medical and family history, allergies, current medications, and any pregnancy, breastfeeding, or plans for pregnancy with your provider.</p><p>Risks, side effects, contraindications, and warnings differ by medication. Review the specific prescribing information and medication guide with your provider, including when to seek urgent care.</p><p><strong>For a medical emergency, call 911.</strong> Do not use this website or an online inquiry for urgent medical concerns.</p><a href={medicalSource} class="source-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Patient information from NIDDK ↗</a>{!program.clinicalReviewApproved && <p class="medical-review">Medical review required: medication-specific safety information will be added once treatment options are confirmed.</p>}</div></section>
<section id="faq" class="faq section wrap"><div class="faq-heading"><h2>GOOD QUESTIONS.<br/><em>Thoughtful answers.</em></h2><p>A little clarity goes a long way.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}<span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>{answer}</p></div></details>)}</div><div class="faq-bottom"><p>Still have something on your mind?</p><Action variant="text"/></div></section>
